Toyshop
Who knows what might be hidden in the dark rafters and shadowy corners of this emporium?

There's a closed oak chest in the northwest corner.

Catharine stands attentively nearby.

You can also see a Towers of Hanoi board, a sundial (on which is a gnomon) and a cardboard box (which is empty) here.

Catharine looks at the shadow on the sundial. "It looks like it's tea-time," she says. "Perhaps you would care to join me in some food?" She opens the chest, picks up a wicker hamper, and closes the chest again.

