>enter chest
You climb into the chest, which turns out to be full of drapery: large engulfing folds of cloth. You struggle to be free of them, and pulling the last one aside, you find yourself walking down a Victorian arcade. Looking around, you see no sign of the toyshop, but clutched in your hands, you find a wrapped parcel with a tag saying "To Isabelle, on her birthday." You are unsure of how you acquired it, but you are somehow sure that Isabelle will enjoy it...


